//! The panefx icon, as raw BGRA pixels.
//!
//! GENERATED by `gen_icon.py`. A pixel "FX" over the teal michaelslop
//! ground, with the flame accent below it.
//!
//! Designed AT 16x16, not drawn large and shrunk -- a tray icon is 16px on
//! most machines and anything downscaled to that turns to mush. The larger
//! size is the same art at a whole-number scale, so every edge stays hard.
//!
//! Raw BGRA rather than a `.ico` so `tray.rs` can hand it straight to
//! `CreateIconIndirect`: no image crate, no file shipped beside the exe, and
//! the project's "no new crates" rule holds.

